{"id":"n15661-1-7","stage":3,"title":"사방 · 四个方向","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15661-1-7-1","ko":"앞에는 강이 있고 뒤에는 산이 있네요.","zh":"前面是河流，后面是山脉呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞에는","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에는","audio":"/audio/2b852193aeabfdb576d4.mp3"}},{"text":"강이","meaning":"江，河","explanation":"강：江，河；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30203","senseId":"1","lemma":"강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강이","audio":"/audio/bb997d3965c7f2634cdb.mp3"}},{"text":"있고","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있고","audio":"/audio/5b58e630dd85c5087c5b.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에는","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에는","audio":"/audio/8ec318eeb31b95855f70.mp3"}},{"text":"산이","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산이","audio":"/audio/20cbfaf7ffe16d608023.mp3"}},{"text":"있네요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있네요","audio":"/audio/8295ec426f5c730a98e7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"d90ed2084b71f17c","term":"강","zh":"江，河","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3","entryId":"30203","definition":"又宽又长、最后流入大海的水流。","pronunciation":["강"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe0cdb8786fb745d5c45.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15661-1-7-2","ko":"네, 사방 어디를 봐도 경치는 아주 좋은 곳입니다.","zh":"是的，无论朝哪个方向看，这里的风景都非常优美。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"사방","meaning":"四个方向","explanation":"사방：四个方向。","readings":[{"term":"사방","audio":"/audio/c3276b781d92f60b8203.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15661","senseId":"1","lemma":"사방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사방","audio":"/audio/c3276b781d92f60b8203.mp3"}},{"text":"어디를","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디를","audio":"/audio/30dd6318827dd406d486.mp3"}},{"text":"봐도","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐도","audio":"/audio/fdd01bd86a193dbd13e5.mp3"}},{"text":"경치는","meaning":"风景，景色","explanation":"경치：风景，景色；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"경치","audio":"/audio/b590a66bb114caf5d529.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26024","senseId":"1","lemma":"경치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경치는","audio":"/audio/ea5838fd18696487e1c4.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"곳입니다.","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳입니다","audio":"/audio/34b0ba0446c5bb41bf39.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c3276b781d92f60b","term":"사방","zh":"四个方向","audio":"/audio/c3276b781d92f60b8203.mp3","entryId":"15661","definition":"东西南北四个方向。","pronunciation":["사ː방"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"b590a66bb114caf5","term":"경치","zh":"风景，景色","audio":"/audio/b590a66bb114caf5d529.mp3","entryId":"26024","definition":"自然或地区美丽的样子。","pronunciation":["경치"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]}],"audio":"/audio/f9b913d2b22fa32fb490.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.692,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15661","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5187,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，无论朝哪个方向看，这里的风景都非常优美。","有什么事要找我吗？","前面是河流，后面是山脉呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的，无论朝哪个方向看，这里的风景都非常优美。","前面是河流，后面是山脉呢。","有什么事要找我吗？"],"answer":0}]}
